At The RA\",\"startDate\":\"2026-07-16T13:00:00.000+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-07-16T14:45:00.000+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Olympic Studios\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"name\":\"Olympic Studios\",\"streetAddress\":\"117-123 Church Road Barnes, London\",\"addressLocality\":\"London\",\"postalCode\":\"SW13 9HL\",\"addressCountry\":\"GB\"}},\"priceRange\":\"£10 - £18.50\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"url\":\"https://web1.empire.mycloudcinema.com/#/book/58212\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-11T18:08:53+01:00\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"image\":\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2419_10_1.jpg\"}</script>            </div>\n                                </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        </section><section id=\"section_4_stack\" class=\"bg-dark py-4 py-lg-5 m-0\"><div class=\"container d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1\"><div class=\"row gx-2 gx-md-4 gy-2 gy-md-4 flex-grow-1\"><div class=\"col-12 d-flex flex-column text-white\"><!-- widget: hero_main --><div class=\"hero-main-widget hm1 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1 justify-content-center\" style=\"position:relative\"><div class=\"row justify-content-center\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:1\"><div class=\"col-lg-10 mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"fjalla-one-regular majortitle fs-4 hm-h text-uppercase p-0 m-0 pb-2\">UNRIVALLED CINEMA</h2><div class=\" pb-2\">Cinema as it’s meant to be - immersive, effortless, and unforgettable. Our screens offer a truly unrivalled experience with state-of-the-art sound and vision. Settle into spacious, reclining seats with ample legroom and personal tables. The Grab & Go bar offers quiet snacks, and curated wines and drinks to enjoy throughout the film.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"container-fluid bg-light mt-auto\">\n    <div class=\"p-1 pt-4 p-lg-5 border-top row\">\n\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 mb-5 mb-lg-3\">\n            <h6 class=\"fjalla-one-regular text-dark mb-4 text-uppercase lh-sm\">A hub of entertainment, with cinema at its heart, set in iconic locations</h6>\n            <div class=\"flex-column text-body-secondary\">\n                <p>Cinema as it&#039;s meant to be - immersive, effortless, and unforgettable. With state-of-the-art sound and vision, our screens offer a truly unrivalled experience. Settle into spacious, reclining seats with ample legroom and personal tables. The Grab &amp; Go bar offers quiet snacks, and curated wines and drinks to enjoy throughout the film.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 row d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mb-5 mb-lg-3 d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm-start\">\n                    <h6 class=\"fjalla-one-regular text-dark text-uppercase mb-4\">Discover</h6>\n                    <ul class=\"nav flex-column\">\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/select-your-cinema\" class=\"p-0\">Locations</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/ecards\" class=\"p-0\">Gift Cards</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/whats-on/events\" class=\"p-0\">Events</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/private-hire\" class=\"p-0\">Private Hire</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/membership\" class=\"p-0\">Membership</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/account\" class=\"p-0\">Sign In</a></p></li>\n                                            </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mb-5 mb-lg-3 d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm-start\">\n                    <h6 class=\"fjalla-one-regular text-dark text-uppercase mb-4\">About</h6>\n                    <ul class=\"nav flex-column\">\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/our-story\" class=\"p-0\">Our Story</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/opening-times\" class=\"p-0\">Opening Times / Find Us</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/get-in-touch\" class=\"p-0\">Get in Touch</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/we-are-hiring\" class=\"p-0\">We&#039;re Hiring</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/accessibility\" class=\"p-0\">Accessibility</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/policies/privacy-policy\" class=\"p-0\">Privacy Policy</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/policies/terms-of-service\" class=\"p-0\">Terms of Service</a></p></li>\n                                            </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n     